<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss November trade data due 0715 GMT on Dec 17.</title>
<headline>Swiss November trade data due 0715 GMT on Dec 17.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Switzerland's balance of trade data for November will be released on Tuesday at 0715 GMT, the Federal Customs Office said on Monday.</p>
<p>The Office also released revised October trade data, showing a revised surplus of 226.8 million Swiss francs against a preliminary surplus of 248.2 million.</p>
</text>
